# Local LLM and TTS

Do

- Run the LLM and TTS on this machine.
- Treat GitHub as source (optional static frontend host). The Python/LLM/TTS app cannot run on GitHub Pages.

Don’t

- Depend on a cloud clone or remote GPU as the default runtime.
- Send chat content or audio to third-party APIs unless the user explicitly asks.
